ou-058-yangjin:p017:m0000","younger_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p017:m0002","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p017","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"謐弟遵彥"}}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p017","quote":"謐弟遵彥，武定中，吏部尚書、華陰縣開國侯。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p017:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p017:m0000"}],"interpretation_note":"逐來源明詞，兄弟只相對長幼、父系共祖未名不補；本源重述不多計獨立見證。"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-ws058-jin-family-17-遵彥","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAED","surname":"楊","ming":"遵彥","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p017","person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p017:m0002","quote":"謐弟遵彥，武定中，吏部尚書、華陰縣開國侯。","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"姓楊為完整同固定見證兩單元及逐步原生近系的編輯讀法；不依ID/label/族望，原名、字、本名與引文不改。","surname_basis":{"kind":"contextual_surname_from_bound_received_family_units","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"原全文名seed及每步已錄具名兄弟、父子或明父祖原詞同一固定魏058見證；非組裝父邊推姓。","source_name_record_id":"name-weishu058-yangchun-exact","source_full_quote":"北都時，朝法嚴急。太和初，吾兄弟三人並居內職，兄在高祖左右，吾與津在文明太后左右。于時口敕，責諸內官，十日仰密得一事，不列便大瞋嫌。諸人多有依敕密列者，亦有太后、高祖中間傳言構間者。吾兄弟自相誡曰：「今忝二聖近臣，母子間甚難，宜深慎之。又列人事，亦何容易，縱被瞋責，慎勿輕言。」十餘年中，不嘗言一人罪過，當時大被嫌責。答曰：「臣等非不聞人言，正恐不審，仰誤聖聽，是以不敢言。」於後終以不言蒙賞。及二聖間言語，終不敢輒爾傳通。太和二十一年，吾從濟州來朝，在清徽堂豫讌。高祖謂諸王、諸貴曰：「北京之日，太后嚴明，吾每得杖，左右因此有是非言語。和朕母子者唯楊椿兄弟。」遂舉賜四兄及我酒。汝等脫若萬一蒙時主知遇，宜深慎言語，不可輕論人惡也。","source_units":[{"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","native_path":"corpus/weishu-weishou/058-yangchun.json","work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","source_revision":2087998,"raw_path":"source-evidence/weishu058-yangchun/primary/weishu058.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"},{"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","native_path":"corpus/weishu-weishou/058-yangjin.json","work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin-ws2087998","source_revision":2087998,"raw_path":"sources/weishu-weishou/weishu058-ws2087998.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"}],"seed_frame":{"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p014","paragraph_sha256":"b339c5134376f2d4d93dc8504cb8f2bba7c96a633f8170e7e1cab0a5434282fe","source_revision":2087998,"raw_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"},"steps":[{"assertion_id":"a-ws058-jin-jin-brother-chun","from_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAB","to_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAE","traversal":"older_to_younger","generation_before":0,"generation_after":0,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p005","quote":"孝昌初，加散騎常侍，尋以本官行定州事。既而近鎮擾亂，侵逼舊京，乃加津安北將軍、假撫軍將軍、北道大都督、右衞，尋轉左衞，加撫軍將軍。始津受命，出據靈丘，而賊帥鮮于脩禮起於博陵，定州危急，遂回師南赴。始至城下，營壘未立，而州軍新敗。津以賊既乘勝，士眾勞疲，柵壘未安，不可擬敵，賊必夜至，則萬無一全，欲移軍入城，更圖後舉。刺史元固稱賊既逼城，不可示弱，閉門不內。津揮刀欲斬門者，軍乃得入城。賊果夜至，見柵空而去。其後，賊攻州城東面，已入羅城，刺史閉小城東門，城中慅擾，不敢出戰。津欲禦賊，長史許被守門不聽，津手劍擊被，不中，被乃走。津開門出戰，斬賊帥一人，殺賊數百。賊退，人心少安。詔除衞尉卿，征官如故，以津兄衞尉卿椿代為左衞。尋加鎮軍將軍、討虜都督，兼吏部尚書、北道行臺。初，津兄椿得罪此州，由鉅鹿人趙略投書所致。及津之至，略舉家逃走，津乃下教慰喻，令其還業。於是闔州愧服，遠近稱之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p005:m0336","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p005:m0338"}],"source_frames":[{"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p005","paragraph_sha256":"5bc8bd425990b51bec5d6af8ec4caf5ef3ebffdf7e72d5b5e032eb4006ee4b57","source_revision":2087998,"raw_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"}],"role_binding":{"kind":"literal_named_younger_xiong_older","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p005","start":336,"end":339,"surface":"津兄椿"}}},{"assertion_id":"a-ws058-jin-yi-father-jin-second","from_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAE","to_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAEB","traversal":"father_to_child","generation_before":0,"generation_after":1,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p009","quote":"永安初，詔除津本將軍、荊州刺史，加散騎常侍、當州都督。津以前在中山陷寇，詣闕固辭，竟不之任。二年，兼吏部尚書，又除車騎將軍、左光祿大夫，仍除吏部。元顥內逼，莊帝將親出討，以津為中軍大都督、兼領軍將軍。未行，顥入。及顥敗，津乃入宿殿中，掃洒宮掖，遣第二子逸封閉府庫，各令防守。及帝入也，津迎於北邙，流涕謝罪，帝深嘉慰之。尋以津為司空、加侍中。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p009:m0126","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p009:m0110"}],"source_frames":[{"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p009","paragraph_sha256":"550b3f218fde2c202e20a1c7918c3f96cc4983ba36a37b9483b01575590370e2","source_revision":2087998,"raw_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"}],"role_binding":{"kind":"named_parent_sending_numbered_son"}},{"assertion_id":"a-ws058-jin-mi-yi","from_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAEB","to_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAEC","traversal":"older_to_younger","generation_before":1,"generation_after":1,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p016","quote":"逸弟謐，字遵智。辟太尉行參軍，歷員外散騎常侍，以功賜爵弘農伯、鎮軍將軍、金紫光祿大夫、衞將軍。在晉陽，為尒朱兆所害。太昌初，贈驃