jin:p016:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p016:m0000","assertion_id":"a-ws058-jin-mi-yi","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AD%8F%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B758&oldid=2087998","scope":"僅明父或具名兄弟鏈作可撤回父系組裝；不補同母、絕對排行，不生成source father。"},{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p009","quote":"永安初，詔除津本將軍、荊州刺史，加散騎常侍、當州都督。津以前在中山陷寇，詣闕固辭，竟不之任。二年，兼吏部尚書，又除車騎將軍、左光祿大夫，仍除吏部。元顥內逼，莊帝將親出討，以津為中軍大都督、兼領軍將軍。未行，顥入。及顥敗，津乃入宿殿中，掃洒宮掖，遣第二子逸封閉府庫，各令防守。及帝入也，津迎於北邙，流涕謝罪，帝深嘉慰之。尋以津為司空、加侍中。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p009:m0126","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p009:m0110","assertion_id":"a-ws058-jin-yi-father-jin-second","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AD%8F%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B758&oldid=2087998","scope":"僅明父或具名兄弟鏈作可撤回父系組裝；不補同母、絕對排行，不生成source father。"}],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-ws058-jin-yi-father-jin-second","sibling_person_ids":["fum_370_iq6_AAAEC","fum_370_iq6_AAAEB"],"sibling_assertion_ids":["a-ws058-jin-zunyan-mi","a-ws058-jin-mi-yi"]},"assembly_id":"family-hongnong-yang-jie-close","root_person_id":"fum_370_iq6","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false}}
